<title>HONG KONG: Trading of Dransfield shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading of Dransfield shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of consumer electronic goods and appliances marketer Dransfield Holdings Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the stock exchange said on Monday.  </p>
<p>The company shares ended HK$0.015 or 3.06 percent down at HK$0.475 on Friday on volume of 100,000 shares.</p>
<p>Dransfield is a marketer of consumer electronics goods and appliances, food and beverages.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
